---

<section class="hero">
	<h1 class="hero-title">Desarrollador Front-End</h1>
	<div class="hero-box">
		<img
			class="box-image"
			src="/image/image-hero-v001.avif"
			alt="Imagen del creador Henry"
		/>
		<span class="box-span">Hola!</span>
		<section class="box-section">
			<h2 class="section-title">Soy Henry Azogue</h2>
			<p class="section-text">
				Desarrollador web enfocado en el <em>Front-end</em> con
				capacidades en <em>Diseño Web</em>, <em
					>Fotografía</em
				> & desarrollo
				<em>Back-end</em>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		color: var(--colore-tamarind);
		padding: 2rem 0;
		margin: 0 var(--padding-global-box);
	}
	.hero-title {
		font-size: var(--size-font-title);
		font-family: var(--font-special);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -2px;
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.hero-box {
		position: relative;
	}
	.box-image {
		width: 100%;
		height: clamp(
			34.6875rem,
			30.5804vw + 28.5714rem,
			77.5rem
		);
		aspect-ratio: 7/5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}
	.box-span {
		position: absolute;
		top: clamp(1.25rem, 2.7679vw + 0.6964rem, 5.125rem);
		left: 0px;
		font-size: var(--size-font-text-normal);
	}
	.box-section {
		position: absolute;
		top: clamp(1.25rem, 2.7679vw + 0.6964rem, 5.125rem);
		right: 0px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 7px;
	}
	.section-title {
		font-family: var(--font-special);
		letter-spacing: -2px;
		font-size: clamp(
			1.75rem,
			3.2143vw + 1.1071rem,
			6.25rem
		);
		width: clamp(
			9.5628rem,
			28.5712vw + 3.8486rem,
			49.5625rem
		);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.section-text {
		margin: 0;
		width: clamp(
			9.5628rem,
			28.5712vw + 3.8486rem,
			49.5625rem
		);
		font-size: var(--size-font-text-normal);
	}
	@media (width <=425px) {
		.box-image {
			object-position: -285px 0px;
		}
	}
	@media (width >= 768px) {
		.header-title {
			letter-spacing: -5px;
		}
	}
</style>
